  "menu_cursor": "7C6A0\u219280130 selects menu cursor record5 at115E74+30, then7AD10 updates image/hotspot throughA2FB8/A2F98. This does not callA3458/recenter orA3118/change sensitivity. Returning to center can result from preceding mode reinitialization, not an observed movement failure diagnosis.",
